            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Reliable Arcanum and Tracker MCP installation</h2>
<p>Arcanum and Tracker MCPs now download independently of the app. FullHouse checks each release before installation and shows when release information is unavailable. Downloads and updates go through Review → Apply.</p>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Publish Arcanum pull requests</strong> — The latest Arcanum MCP release adds publish_pr in read-write mode, so connected assistants can publish prepared pull requests when you ask them to.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
